==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|proletarius||a man whose only wealth is his offspring, or whose sole service to the state is as father}}, from {{m|la|proles||offspring, posterity}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or relating to the [[proletariat]].

